Package: perufauna
Title: Integrate Taxonomic and Conservation Data for Peruvian Fauna
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , 
    "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Cross-references scientific names against Peruvian bird and mammal
    checklists and conservation lists using 'avesperu', 'perumammals',
    'citesperu', and 'perufaunads004'. Provides integrated matching and summary
    functions, flags approximate names for manual review, and offers an optional
    'Shiny' application for batch queries and file exports. The mammal checklist
    follows Pacheco et al. (2021) <doi:10.15381/rpb.v28i4.21019>.
